    <h1>Hello</h1>
    <p class="section__intro">I'm Ste Pammenter, a Tech Lead at <a href="https://www.acorninsure.co.uk/non-standard-home-insurance">Acorn Group</a>, where I lead the team behind our household insurance product, covering quote enrichment, policies and claims.</p>
    <p>I'm a backend engineer at heart, working with C# (.NET 8-10) to build scalable, asynchronous systems on Azure. I'm big on distributed architectures, microservices and event-driven patterns, and on making sure things don't fall over under load. Clean code, DDD and proper testing are my jam.</p>
    <p>I'm a <a href="https://learn.microsoft.com/api/credentials/share/en-us/ste-pammenter/DE05394C53DAB03D?sharingId=77956A493FCEC46F">certified Azure Developer Associate</a>, with plenty of hands-on time in Container Apps, Service Bus, SQL, CosmosDB and Redis.</p>
    <p>Before Acorn I was a Senior Software Engineer at <a href="https://www.crezco.com/">Crezco</a>, building high-reliability payment systems. Earlier on I led engineering teams and built SaaS products across legal, sports and HR. Turns out I enjoy jumping between domains!</p>
